{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09582","headline":"太白东溪张老舍即事寄舍弟侄等 · 岑参","name":"太白东溪张老舍即事寄舍弟侄等","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渭上秋雨过，北风何骚骚。\n天晴诸山出，太白峰最高。\n主人东溪老，两耳生长毫。\n远近知百岁，子孙皆二毛。\n中庭井兰上，一架猕猴桃。\n石泉饭香粳，酒瓮开新槽。\n爱兹田中趣，始悟世上劳。\n我行有胜事，书此寄尔曹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09582.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09582","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}